>> title: Lemon Rice
>> category: Rice, Beans & Grains
>> tags: rice, lemon, south indian, vegetarian
>> counters: Curry House
>> aka: chitranna, elumichai sadam, nimbu chawal
>> pairs-with: dal-tadka
>> servings: 4
>> time: 35 min

>> step: cook 15 min, spread to cool
Cook @basmati rice{1%cup}(200 g; rinsed) in @water{1 1/2%cups}(355 mL) with @kosher salt{1 1/4%tsp} until tender, ~{15%min}, then spread on a tray to cool.

>> step: pop 1 min
Pop @black mustard seeds{1%tsp} and @urad dal{1%tsp} in @peanut oil{3%Tbs} in a #skillet{} for ~{1%min}.

>> step: fry 2 min
Fry @&(~1)tempering{} with @raw peanuts{2%Tbs}, @dried red chiles{2}(broken), @curry leaves{10}, and @ground turmeric{1/2%tsp} until the peanuts colour, ~{2%min}.

>> step: toss
Toss @&(~3)cooled rice{} with @&(~1)tempering{}, @lemon juice{3%Tbs}, and @cilantro{2%Tbs}.
